sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Farmer as Farmer Member
    participant NextJS as Next.js Frontend (PWA)
    participant FastAPI as FastAPI Backend
    participant Engine as Water Requirement Engine
    participant ORTools as Google OR-Tools Solver
    participant Mediator as LangGraph AI Mediator
    participant DB as SQLite / SQLAlchemy

    Farmer->>NextJS: Submit Crop Stage & Land Details
    NextJS->>FastAPI: POST /api/water-request
    FastAPI->>Engine: Calculate crop water demand (Kc, soil, weather)
    Engine-->>FastAPI: Calculated Demand (Liters)
    FastAPI->>ORTools: Solve linear optimization model
    Note over ORTools: Hard constraints: Sum(Allocations) <= Canal Capacity
    ORTools-->>FastAPI: Optimal Fair Allocation Matrix & Time Slots
    FastAPI->>DB: Store Allocation & Immutable Audit Log
    FastAPI-->>NextJS: Display Allocation & Fairness Score (0-100)
    
    alt Farmer Accepts
        Farmer->>NextJS: Accept Allocation
        NextJS->>FastAPI: POST /api/allocation/accept
        FastAPI->>DB: Update status to 'Accepted'
    else Farmer Raises Objection
        Farmer->>NextJS: File Objection (Crop in critical stage)
        NextJS->>FastAPI: POST /api/mediation/objection
        FastAPI->>Mediator: Run Multi-Agent Mediation Evaluation
        Mediator->>ORTools: Re-verify feasibility of compromise
        ORTools-->>Mediator: Validated Reallocation
        Mediator-->>FastAPI: Proposed Settlement Proposal
        FastAPI-->>NextJS: Display AI Mediation Proposal & Rationale
        Farmer->>NextJS: Accept Compromise Proposal
        NextJS->>FastAPI: POST /api/mediation/accept-proposal
        FastAPI->>DB: Commit Locked Agreement to Audit Trail
    end
